cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "n-invariants"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for the article "Distributions of metric n-point invariants and
  applications to molecular evolution": sample-size bounds for estimating the distributions
  of metric n-point invariants by sampling, a sampler for empirical curvature measures and
  invariant distributions under a chosen metric, and the code reproducing the figures and
  analyses of the article.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/subthaumic/n-invariants"
